A quoted span after a hosted span's closer leaves the follower outside

```
> > - %%%
> > %%%
> > %%%
> > x
t
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li></li>
    </ul>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>t</p>
```

```
> - %%%
> %%%
> %%%
> x
t
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li></li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p>t</p>
```

```
> > > 1. %%%%
> > > %%%%
> > > %%%%
> > > x
- t
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <blockquote>
      <ol>
        <li></li>
      </ol>
    </blockquote>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
<ul>
  <li>t</li>
</ul>
```

